data: {"type":"content_block_start","index":2,"content_block":{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01LrAogHd1o8jDvErAZ7UyR2","name":"DecideCase","input":{"runId":"triage-order-total","kind":"auto-fix","reason":"Cause is in our code (high confidence): OrderApi.GetOrderTotal in src/OrderService/Api/OrderTotal.cs line 18 indexes DiscountRates[order.DiscountCode], which throws KeyNotFoundException for the retired code SUMMER25 on order 1003. Expected behaviour per runbook: an unknown or retired code gives no discount (total equals subtotal), rounded to 2 decimals; totals for WELCOME10, VIP20 and no-code orders must not change; escalate to orders if the fix would change a valid-code total."}}}

